<title>PHILIPPINES: Philippine January jobless rate down to 7.7 percent.</title>
<headline>Philippine January jobless rate down to 7.7 percent.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-03-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Philippines' unemployment rate in January 1997 was down to 7.7 percent from 8.3 percent in the year-ago period, the National Statistics Office reported on Thursday.</p>
<p>About 2.3 million people were unemployed of the total labour force in January, with the highest unemployment rate at 12.1 percent in Metro Manila and 2.6 percent in areas outside Manila, the agency said.</p>
